<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:itunes="http://www.itunes.com/dtds/podcast-1.0.dtd" version="2.0"><channel><title>Watercooler - daily.dev</title><link>https://app.daily.dev/squads/watercooler</link><atom:link href="http://127.0.0.1/daily/squads/watercooler" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>The Watercooler Squad is an important place for all things unimportant and nonsense at daily.dev. It’s designed to waste your time and distract you, buckle up 😻 🤹🏽‍♀️ - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 00:24:23 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>When you managed to to create an app in 30 minutes from an example, but later need 3 day deep dive and refactor half of the project to make one tiny c...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--6XOXHPIp--/f_auto/v1753775585/ugc/content_18adc849-62eb-4622-b3eb-4b0511f9662b?_a=BAMClqZW0&quot; alt=&quot;download&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt; </description><link>https://app.daily.dev/posts/when-you-managed-to-to-create-an-app-in-30-minutes-from-an-example-but-later-need-3-day-deep-dive-a-l78qceltn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/l78QCeltN</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 08:14:36 GMT</pubDate><author>Denis Bolkovskis</author></item><item><title>I am #7. What about you?</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--58gMhC4P--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2012&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </description><link>https://app.daily.dev/posts/i-am-7-what-about-you--0fl6wxumh</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/0fl6wXumh</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Jul 2025 18:36:11 GMT</pubDate><author>Denis Bolkovskis</author><itunes:image href="https://medi