_auto/v1751477158/ugc/content_1cf4bde6-8ecb-4a58-b791-adc334f242d8?_a=BAMClqZW0&quot; alt=&quot;IMG_7025&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt; </description><link>https://app.daily.dev/posts/maybe-they-had-good-scrum-masters--jrlj5wtam</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/JrLj5wTam</guid><pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 17:29:57 GMT</pubDate><author>Denis Bolkovskis</author><category>ai</category><category>productivity</category></item><item><title>Who are we? CEO’s!</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--B8w8RiY6--/f_auto/v1751348746/ugc/content_8e1387c0-ead2-47b4-8d41-21efb6981bce?_a=BAMClqZW0&quot; alt=&quot;IMG_7020&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt; </description><link>https://app.daily.dev/posts/who-are-we-ceo-s--p6tq9dedp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/p6Tq9DEdp</guid><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 08:58:09 GMT</pubDate><author>Denis Bolkovskis</author><category>tech-news</category><category>ai</category><category>machine-learning</category></item><item><title>200,000 units are ready with a million more well on the way</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--HRgLpUt6--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2003&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </description><link>https://app.daily.dev/posts/200-000-units-are-ready-with-a-million-more-well-on-the-way-g5jktat9y</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/G5Jktat9Y</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Jun 2025 20:17:26 GMT</pubDate><author>Denis Bolkovskis</author><itunes:image href="https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--HRgLpUt6--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2003"></itunes:image><category>ai</category><category>startup</category><category>venture-capital</category><category>entrepreneurship</category></item><item><title>Am i the only one who notices this?😭😭🙈🙈</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--a_nA04v1--/f_auto/v1751051360/ugc/content_82e70836-1f66-44de-90f8-d69f20cae242?_a=BAMClqZW0&quot; alt=&quot;zoomit&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt; </description><link>https://app.daily.dev/posts/am-i-the-only-one-who-notices-this--glwxgdbvi</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/GLWxGdbVI</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Jun 2025 20:17:10 GMT</pubDate><author>Levi</author><category>tech-news</category><category>security</category><category>webdev</category><category>cloud</category><category>devops</category></item><item><title>New rules and guidelines</title><description>&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone! It’s been a while since we opened this squad and after &lt;strong&gt;6k members&lt;/strong&gt; and almost &lt;strong&gt;2k posts&lt;/strong&gt;, it’s time to update our rules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can see the new rules below, or just visit the &lt;a href=&quot;https://dly.to/GEIZObzVbLz&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow&quot;&gt;pinned post&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What We’re About&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Watercooler is all about:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Generating hilarity and nonsense&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sharing delightful moments of distraction&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Casual off-topic discussions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Memes and dev humor&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Light-hearted debates (e.g., light mode vs. dark mode? 🌓)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remember, as a public Squad, your posts might appear in the main daily.dev feed. Keep it fun, but keep it clean!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Rules (because even nonsense needs structure)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be respectful and kind.&lt;/strong&gt; We don’t do hate here. 💜&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No self-promotion.&lt;/strong&gt; This isn’t the place to market yourself or your projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay on theme.&lt;/strong&gt; Keep it light, funny, and dev-culture related. Serious conversations belong elsewhere.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don’t spam.&lt;/strong&gt; Quality over quantity, folks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No harmful content.&lt;/strong&gt; Viruses, IP grabbers, or any malicious content will get you permanently banned.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Watch your language.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respect privacy.&lt;/strong&gt; Don’t post anyone’s personal information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Listen to the mods.&lt;/strong&gt; If a moderator asks you to stop something, please comply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep introductions to designated threads.&lt;/strong&gt; No standalone introduction posts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No product feedback or reading streak posts.&lt;/strong&gt; This isn’t the place for daily.dev feature discussions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No politics.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What We Want to See&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Your best (or worst) dev memes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Embarrassing dev stories&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Silly polls and light-hearted debates&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Casual chit-chat about dev life&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remember, Watercooler is here for you to relax, laugh, and connect with fellow devs in a casual setting. Let’s keep it fun, friendly, and slightly ridiculous!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, go forth and meme responsibly! 🎉&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt; </description><link>https://app.daily.dev/posts/new-rules-and-guidelines-fnfb3ovyf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/FNfb3OVYf</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Sep 2024 10:35:04 GMT</pubDate><author>Ido Shamun</author></item><item><title>Code of Conduct 🍄</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/public/welcome_post&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Hey there, fellow devs! Welcome to Watercooler, daily.dev’s first public Squad and your go-to spot for all things fun and non-professional in the dev world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What We’re About&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Watercooler is all about:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Generating hilarity and nonsense&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sharing delightful moments of distraction&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Casual off-topic discussions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Memes and dev humor&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Light-hearted debates (e.g., light mode vs. dark mode? 🌓)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remember, as a public Squad, your posts might appear in the main daily.dev feed. Keep it fun, but keep it clean!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Rules (because even nonsense needs structure)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be respectful and kind.&lt;/strong&gt; We don’t do hate here. 💜&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No self-promotion.&lt;/strong&gt; This isn’t the place to market yourself or your projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay on theme.&lt;/strong&gt; Keep it light, funny, and dev-culture related. Serious conversations belong elsewhere.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don’t spam.&lt;/strong&gt; Quality over quantity, folks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No harmful content.&lt;/strong&gt; Viruses, IP grabbers, or any malicious content will get you permanently banned.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Watch your language.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respect privacy.&lt;/strong&gt; Don’t post anyone’s personal information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Listen to the mods.&lt;/strong&gt; If a moderator asks you to stop something, please comply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep introductions to designated threads.&lt;/strong&gt; No standalone introduction posts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No product feedback or reading streak posts.&lt;/strong&gt; This isn’t the place for daily.dev feature discussions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No politics.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What We Want to See&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Your best (or worst) dev memes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Embarrassing dev stories&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Silly polls and light-hearted debates&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Casual chit-chat about dev life&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remember, Watercooler is here for you to relax, laugh, and connect with fellow devs in a casual setting. Let’s keep it fun, friendly, and slightly ridiculous!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, go forth and meme responsibly! 🎉&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt; </description><link>https://app.daily.dev/posts/code-of-conduct--xxpptc1of</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/xxpPTc1Of</guid><pubDate>Sun, 04 Jun 2023 07:57:05 GMT</pubDate><author>Ido Shamun</author><itunes:image href="https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/public/welcome_post"></itunes:image></item></channel></rss>